Ensure seamless integration with existing JavaScript modules and avoid conflicts with other scripts already present in the document. Consider the impact of script loading on page load times and user experience. Make trade-offs between efficient script fetching, caching strategies, and minimizing HTTP requests to enhance performance. Implement error handling for failed script fetches and provide fallbacks where necessary.

